Z||000002||FieroLisa||08-14-2001||12:51 PM||||What Fiero to get is totally up to you. Before you buy anything, check out (at least pics and general stats of) every model for every year, most of them are at least slightly different. Just take your time, there are good ones out there, but ya have to sift thru the misused ones first.<BR>Don't hesitate to have a good mechanic to thoroughly check out the car, if you aren't one yourself.<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.webjolt.f2s.com/pictures/fierolisa.gif">    <BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fierolisa/" TARGET=_blank>FieroLisa's Website</A>*<A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/ncfieros/" TARGET=_blank>NC Tarheels Fieros Site</A><P>AIM: FieroLisa||||reg||1
